{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48782","headline":"九月九日 · 崔善爲","name":"九月九日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九日重阳节，三秋季月残。\n菊花催晚气，萸房辟早寒。\n霜浓鹰击远，雾重雁飞难。\n谁忆龙山外，萧条边兴阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔善爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}